    "Name": "Phoenix Hawk IIC",
    "Details": "A cross between the primary configuration and the Phoenix Hawk IIC 2, this variant carries an Ultra AC/10 in the right torso and a pair of LRM-20s in the left torso. A Machine Gun is mounted in the head and the center torso. The missile launchers carry four tons of ammunition, the autocannon has two tons of ammunition and the machine guns have half a ton of ammunition.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.18</color></b>",
